{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辛未五月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此非問者本意所在。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問者本意在此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以下答文、皆約比辨釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文中亦有時指前後二類者、為是兼明、非正意也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即賊住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上原文"}
