{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上原文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上大師之說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上皆大師之說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見梵網合註緣起中。今未檢原書、略述其大意如此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上錄律攝大意、非全文也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先示懺法大略"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮懺七日之後。每晨以身口意三輪三\n擲、皆純善者、即名得清淨相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五八十具等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上依藕益大師文挈錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但觀善惡種子有無。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二皆有、不再擲。或再擲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唯取前相應者問。不符再擲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先羯磨後戒相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菩薩一比丘二"}
