{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "最好用九個閉目三擲後再看"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是比丘比丘尼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此經余已書寫、佛學書局流通。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "限於一日夜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "例如欲連續受一月者。於第一日晨朝發心受時、陳明一月。\n則此一月限內皆有效、不須再受。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因自誓受故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牀足太高"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依佛說八種長養功德經錄出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "案即一日夜中過午不食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "案受八戒者、正屬在家二眾。亦兼通於出家諸眾、如藥師經中所明。此文且據在家者言、故云優婆塞。\n若出家者、隨宜稱之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說又誦伽陀頌曰"}
